        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5.公式识别"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                146,
                92,
                280,
                114
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "B.5.3按式(B.5.3)计算矿料的合成毛体积相对密度 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\gamma _ { \\mathfrak { s b } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "0"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                174,
                147,
                616,
                162
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\gamma_ {\\mathrm{ab}} = \\frac {1 0 0}{\\frac {P _ {1}}{\\gamma_ {1}} + \\frac {P _ {2}}{\\gamma_ {2}} + \\cdots + \\frac {P _ {\\mathrm{n}}}{\\gamma_ {\\mathrm{n}}}}\\tag{B.5.3}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/11b1d1f4c935d8ac52ea9d83201d9893a30ed178ff66891c3fa77544f9723ab8.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                393,
                166,
                589,
                210
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "式中： "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "P _ { 1 } , P _ { 2 } , \\cdots , P _ { n }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "—各种 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathcal { B }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "料成分的配合比，其和为100；"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                157,
                214,
                613,
                229
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\gamma _ { 1 } , \\gamma _ { 2 } , \\cdots , \\gamma _ { n }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "—各种矿料相应的毛体积相对密度。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                203,
                233,
                594,
                247
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "注：1.沥青混合料配合比设计时，均采用毛体积相对密度(无量纲)，不采用毛体积密度，故无需进行密度的水温修正。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                252,
                818,
                265
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "B.5.4 按式(B.5.4)计算矿料的合成表观相对密度 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\gamma _ { \\mathfrak { m } }"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "o"
                    }
